\section{Type-Checker Semantic Error Detection}
\sectionrule

The following four programs in \code{D3/semantic/} are syntactically valid (the
D3 P1 parser accepts them) but semantically invalid. Each is rejected by
\code{D2/ans --check} with a line-numbered, actionable diagnostic. This demonstrates
