  - `list_for_compound_parameter.ans`: Tests `let compounds = [water, methane]; for (let c in compounds) { molar_mass(c); }` — verifies list<compound> element type propagates correctly to typed parameter
  - `list_index_compound_member.ans`: Tests `compounds[0].formula` and `compounds[0].name` — verifies list index returns element type enabling member access
  - `list_index_number_assignment.ans`: Tests `numbers[0] = 10; numbers[1] += 5;` — verifies list index as assignment target

