  - `empty_list.ans`: `let values = [];` → "empty list requires an element type"
  - `formula_index_assignment.ans`: `formula[element] = 2` → "formula atom counts are read-only"
  - `function_call_assignment.ans`: `value() = 2` → "function call cannot be an assignment target"
